&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know we’re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did I ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we’re collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar e-commerce industry from the ground up. We are one of the fastest-growing e-commerce companies that established an unparalleled reputation for being a dominant and reliable force in South Korean commerce. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our inception. We are all entrepreneurs surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional trade-offs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.  &lt;br&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fulfilment Optimization (FO) owns the systems that decide how every Coupang order is planned, distributed, and fulfilled. Our Tier-1 services sit on the critical path of Coupang&#39;s ecommerce order flow — processing every order in real time across Korea and Taiwan. We operate multiple interconnected platform components:&lt;br&gt;-Business Engine — Core order planning and distribution orchestrator (Kotlin/Spring Boot). Runs 5 distinct pipelines (Domestic, Cross-Market, 3PL, PDD, Replan) using a hexagonal architecture with pluggable processors, pruners, and manifest-based orchestration.&lt;br&gt;-Planner Solver — Mixed-Integer Programming (MIP) optimization engine (Python/CPLEX) that minimizes total fulfilment cost across inventory, capacity, network, and delivery-promise constraints with sub-second latency requirements.&lt;br&gt;-Network Manager — Manages fulfilment network topology, transportation cost, FC capacity, middle-mile logistics, and cross-FC consolidation (CFCC) across 90+ REST/gRPC endpoints.&lt;br&gt;-FO Inventory — Real-time inventory availability, allocation, SKU management, and event-driven sync across multiple upstream sources (Kafka, Cassandra, Elasticsearch, Redis).&lt;br&gt;-WMS Fulfilment — Order distribution, inventory allocation, fulfilment centre orchestration, shipment, delivery, and outbound management (Java/Spring, 138+ domain subpackages, Drools rules engine).&lt;br&gt;-Online Simulation — Real-time simulation platform for testing planning changes against production-like order streams.&lt;br&gt;-FO Workflows — Temporal-based workflow orchestration for long-running fulfilment processes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for a Senior Staff Engineer who can operate across deep implementation and broad architecture. You&amp;nbsp;will set the technical direction for Tier-1 fulfilment systems, write and review production code, design systems that&amp;nbsp;scale under heavy ecommerce traffic, and raise the engineering bar across the organization. The engineer in this role will directly influence how millions of orders are fulfilled every day. Every architectural&amp;nbsp;decision — solver latency, pruning strategy, network cost calculation, inventory allocation algorithm impacts&lt;br&gt;customer delivery promise, fulfilment cost, and operational efficiency across Coupang&#39;s entire ecommerce platform&amp;nbsp;in Korea and Taiwan.&lt;br&gt;This is a rare opportunity to work at the intersection of large-scale distributed systems, real-time optimization, and&amp;nbsp;ecommerce fulfilment — with direct, measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-Design and build scalable, reliable Tier-1 services for order planning, fulfilment optimization, inventory&amp;nbsp;allocation, and network cost management — systems that process every Coupang order in real time.&lt;br&gt;-Own architecture across distributed systems involving gRPC service meshes, Kafka event pipelines, CPLEX&amp;nbsp;optimization solvers, multi-layer caching (Redis, S3-backed Loadable Stores), and multi-region deployments.&lt;br&gt;-Write production code in Kotlin and Java and set the bar for correctness, performance, and operational safety&amp;nbsp;across the team.&lt;br&gt;-Lead design and code reviews — identify correctness issues, scalability risks, and operational gaps in systems&amp;nbsp;handling latency-sensitive order flows (sub-second solver deadlines, P99 monitoring with 3-5s alert thresholds).&lt;br&gt;-Drive reliability for mission-critical services — circuit breakers, graceful degradation (hard/soft pruners with&amp;nbsp;fallback), observability, and incident prevention.&lt;br&gt;-Partner with Product, Data Science, and Operations to translate fulfilment optimization goals into technical execution — PDD rationalization, CFCC (Cross-FC Consolidation), CFlow transport planning, inventory group management, and solver model improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-Mentor engineers and create durable technical mechanisms (pipeline patterns, adapter abstractions, feature flag&amp;nbsp;discipline) that scale beyond individual projects &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-Proven experience designing and operating high-scale distributed systems with strict latency and reliability&amp;nbsp;requirements&lt;br&gt;-Excellent hands-on coding ability in Kotlin or Java (backend systems at scale)&lt;br&gt;-Deep understanding of system design — API design, concurrency, data modelling, caching strategies, messaging,&amp;nbsp;service-to-service communication (gRPC, REST)&lt;br&gt;-Strong code review skills — ability to identify subtle correctness, performance, and reliability issues in complex&lt;br&gt;codebases&lt;br&gt;-Experience with production-grade systems handling high QPS, large data volumes, or Tier-1 SLAs&lt;br&gt;-Experience with event-driven architectures using Kafka at scale&lt;br&gt;-Experience with multi-region systems — region-specific routing, data isolation, cross-border fulfilment&lt;br&gt;-Experience with resilience engineering — circuit breakers, retry strategies, load testing, capacity planning,&amp;nbsp;graceful degradation patterns&lt;br&gt;-Track record of technical leadership — setting architecture direction, driving cross-team alignment, mentoring&amp;nbsp;senior engineers&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-Experience in ecommerce, fulfilment, supply chain, logistics, inventory, order management, or planning&amp;nbsp;systems&lt;br&gt;-Experience with optimization systems — solvers (CPLEX, OR-Tools), decision engines, constraint programming, or&amp;nbsp;data-science-integrated production systems&lt;br&gt;-Experience with Agentic AI tools for development and code review — using AI-assisted coding agents (e.g.,&amp;nbsp;Cursor, Copilot, Devin, Claude Code) to accelerate development velocity, improve code review quality, and&amp;nbsp;automate repetitive engineering tasks&lt;br&gt;-Experience with Spec-Driven Development — defining system behaviour through specifications&amp;nbsp;(OpenAPI/Swagger, Protocol Buffers, API-first design, contract-first development) before implementation,&amp;nbsp;ensuring well-defined contracts between services &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Type of work model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
