&lt;li&gt;Those eligible for employment protection (recipients of veteran’s benefits, the disabled, etc.) may receive preferential treatment for employment in accordance with applicable laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
